China Stories | First Batch: From Qin to the Early Han
15 short-story English editions
Target public length: roughly 700–1,200 Chinese characters per original; English rewritten for readers with little or no prior knowledge of Chinese history.
Principle: one odd thing, one explanation, stop before the larger theory begins.

